?"The Stock Manager requested a correction. Update the quantities and resubmit."
:status===LIFE_RA_PENDING
?"This discrepancy is waiting for Stock Manager approval. Neither the original transfer nor the reverse adjustment has been posted yet."
:status===LIFE_RA_REJECTED
?"This discrepancy request was rejected. No original or reverse stock movement was posted."
